# Code owners for this repository.
#
# Every pull request automatically requests a review from the owners listed
# here. Combined with branch protection ("Require review from Code Owners"),
# this is what satisfies the two-party review requirement.
#
# NOTE FOR THE ORG TRANSFER: replace the handle below with the owning org team
# (e.g. `* @google-gemini/<team>`). Create the team FIRST — GitHub silently
# ignores a CODEOWNERS entry that names a team which does not exist or has no
# access to the repo, which fails open with no review required. A second
# maintainer must be named before branch protection is enabled, or required
# review will block the sole author from landing anything.

